UPDATE companies SET description='Stixon Labels operates from Albuquerque, New Mexico, where it was established in 1991 by founder Robert W. Chavez. The business traces its roots to 1955 when Chavez began designing and selling labels, adding flexible packaging in 1961 and forming New Mexico Plastics in 1985. Today the company is owned by Chavez’s daughters—Beverly, Julie, Barbara, and Cristina—who grew up in the label manufacturing business and now lead it as a family-owned operation.

The company manufactures custom pressure-sensitive labels and flexible packaging using flexographic printing, producing labels up to 13.75 by 15 inches. It also provides design and artwork services through a computerized art department, foil stamping, and thermal-transfer blank labels. The staff includes press operators with tenures exceeding 30 years, and most employees have been with the company for more than 15 years.

Stixon serves wineries, distilleries, food and beverage producers, and personal-care brands. Its client list includes Gruet Winery and St. Clair Winery in New Mexico, Headframe Spirits in Montana, Dion’s Pizza Salad Dressings, 505 Southwestern Chile & Salsa, El Pinto Chile & Salsa, New Mexico Piñon Coffee, Sombra Professional Therapy Products, and Marble Brewery, along with retail packaging such as foil-stamped shopping bags.

The company emphasizes service as its differentiator, offering creative, cost-effective solutions from design to finished product. Its long-tenured team and family ownership are cited as reasons for consistent quality and responsiveness.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Flexographic printing", "Custom pressure-sensitive labels", "Flexible packaging", "Label design and artwork services", "Foil stamping", "Thermal-transfer blank labels", "Packaging distribution"], "industries": ["Wine and spirits", "Food and beverage", "Personal care and therapy products", "Craft brewing", "Retail packaging"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Excellent service sets Stixon Labels apart from other label suppliers", "Creative and cost-effective solutions from design to finished product", "Computerized art department accepting a variety of design formats", "Staff with 15+ years average tenure, pressman with 30+ years", "Family-owned with label-making heritage dating to 1955"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1991 by Robert W. Chavez -> /", "Located in Albuquerque, New Mexico -> /", "Family-owned by sisters Beverly, Julie, Barbara, Cristina -> /", "Produces custom pressure-sensitive labels up to 13.75\" x 15\" -> /", "Flexographic printing process -> /", "Clients include Gruet Winery, Headframe Spirits, Dion''s Pizza Salad Dressings, 505 Southwestern, El Pinto, St. Clair Winery, New Mexico Pi\u00f1on Coffee, Sombra Professional Therapy Products, Marble Brewery -> /", "New Mexico Plastics formed 1985, credentials date to 1955 -> /", "Long-tenured staff (15+ years, pressman 30+ years) -> /", "Computerized art department -> /", "Excellent service as differentiator -> /", "Founded year 1991 from database -> db", "Headquarters Albuquerque, New Mexico from database -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Stixon Labels is a manufacturer of custom pressure sensitive labe