UPDATE companies SET description='Summit Packaging Systems, founded in 1976, is headquartered in Manchester, New Hampshire. The company operates five manufacturing facilities worldwide, including locations in Racine, Wisconsin; Almere, Netherlands; Tarnow, Poland; Pilar, Argentina; and Toluca, Mexico.

