UPDATE companies SET description='Sun Up Zero Down was founded in 2013 in Egg Harbor Township, New Jersey. The company has grown into a regional solar installation provider backed by over 50 years of combined industry experience among its team members.

The company designs and installs solar energy systems for residential and commercial properties across six states: New Jersey, Pennsylvania, New York, Connecticut, Massachusetts, and Illinois. Its full-service process covers site evaluation (using satellite imagery and 3D shade modeling), financing assistance, permitting, installation, and utility interconnection. Installations typically take one to two days, though utility meter approval can add three to six weeks. Beyond solar, Sun Up Zero Down also offers roof replacement as a dealer for major shingle manufacturers, and provides ongoing maintenance including system diagnostics, inverter troubleshooting (SolarEdge, Enphase, SMA), panel replacement, and critter guard installation. To date, the firm has completed thousands of installations for more than 2,000 property owners.

Customers range from homeowners seeking to reduce electric bills to commercial property owners pursuing energy independence. The company serves clients throughout its six-state footprint, with detailed county-level coverage in New Jersey and Pennsylvania. Projects are customized to each property''s roof, energy usage, and shading conditions.

Sun Up Zero Down emphasizes a turnkey approach, handling all paperwork, design, permits, and utility coordination. It differentiates itself through price transparency (no hidden fees), full licensing and insurance including workers'' compensation, and a 25-year product warranty on roofing materials. The company has earned three Gold medals in the "Best of The Press" awards and appeared on the Inc. 5000 list of fastest-growing companies.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation (residential and commercial)", "Solar system design", "Site evaluation (virtual and in-person)", "Shade analysis and 3D modeling", "Financing assistance and zero-down options", "Permitting and paperwork management", "Utility interconnection coordination", "Solar system maintenance and diagnostics", "System removal and reinstallation", "Solar panel replacement", "Inverter troubleshooting and replacement (SolarEdge, Enphase, SMA)", "Array Edge Screen (Critter Guard) installation", "Roof replacement", "Custom proposal generation"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Roofing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["SolarEdge inverters", "Enphase inverters", "SMA inverters", "Array Edge Screen (Critter Guard)"], "volume": "Over 2,000 installations completed", "lead_time": "Installation 1-2 days; utility interconnection 3-6 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Zero-down financing for qualified customers", "End-to-end project management from site evaluation to utility interconnection", "Average installation completed in 1-2 days", "Service expertise across SolarEdge, Enphase, and SMA inverter platforms", "Roof replacement offered alongside solar as premier shingle dealer", "Price transparency with no hidden fees"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2013 -> db and /", "Headquarters Egg Harbor Township, New Jersey -> db", "Operates in six states: NJ, PA, NY, CT, MA, IL -> /", "Over 50 years combined industry experience -> /", "Thousands of successful solar installations -> /", "More than 2,000 property owners served -> /services", "Zero-down financing for qualified customers -> /", "Average installation 1-2 days -> /", "Utility meter install up to 3-6 weeks -> /", "Services SolarEdge, Enphase, SMA inverters -> /services", "Offers roof replacement as premier dealer -> /services", "Fully licensed and insured with workers'' comp and liability -> /services", "Price transparency, no hidden fees -> /services", "25-year product warranty on roofing materials -> /services", "Three Gold medals in Best of The Press -> /", "Inc. 5000 recognition -> /", "Array Edge Screen (Critter Guard) installation -> /services", "Site evaluation with satellite imagery and 3D shade modeling -> /", "Serves residential and commercial customers -> /", "County-level service areas in NJ and PA -> /services"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Since 2013, Sun Up Zero Down has been a leading provider of solar installation services.", "founded_year": "2013", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='sun-up-zero-down' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Sun Valley Solar Solutions was founded in 2006 in Chandler, Arizona. The company began with a focus on quality and ethical practices to build long-term customer relationships and a stable business.

The company provides full in-house solar and energy storage services for residential and commercial customers. Its capabilities span system design, installation, and ongoing service for solar arrays, battery storage, EV chargers, and panel removal and reinstallation.

Sun Valley serves homeowners across Arizona and commercial clients including PepsiCo, Sub-Zero Group, and Voya Financial. The firm also works with residential customers through its prepaid lease program, which bundles financing and installation under a single local team.

