UPDATE companies SET description='Superb Metals was founded in 1986 in Minneola, Florida, as a supplier of architectural sheet metal for roofing and building envelope applications.

The company custom fabricates standing seam metal roof systems to project specifications and produces custom flashing components such as chimney caps, radius coping, window pans, and Z flashing. It also operates a wholesale division supplying drip edge, butyl tape, RoofIvent Roto vents, Ecos, and other standing seam roofing accessories. A proprietary mechanically seamed system, branded the Guardian System, is engineered to meet Florida’s Miami-Dade building code for extreme wind resistance.

Superb Metals serves roofing contractors and homeowners across central Florida, with project examples including high-end residential roofs in Tavares and commercial building envelopes. Its customer base spans both new construction and renovation projects requiring durable, energy-efficient metal roofing and flashing solutions.

The company’s stated mission emphasizes fast turnaround, personalized consultation drawn from over 40 years of industry experience, fair pricing, and responsive customer service. Its Guardian System is marketed as a storm-rated solution capable of withstanding winds over 325 mph, positioning the firm as a specialist in code-compliant, high-performance metal roofing.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Standing seam metal roof fabrication", "Custom metal flashing fabrication (chimney caps, radius coping, window pans, Z flashing)", "Wholesale architectural sheet metal materials distribution", "Panel profiling", "Mechanically seamed roofing system design and fabrication (Guardian System)"], "industries": ["Roofing", "Commercial construction", "Residential construction", "Architectural sheet metal", "Building envelope"], "materials": ["Galvalume", "Kynar-coated steel", "Butyl tape", "RoofIvent Roto", "Ecos", "Drip edge"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fast turnaround from quoting to delivery", "Personalized consultation with over 40 years of sheet metal and roofing experience", "Fair pricing focused on contractor and homeowner bottom lines", "Guardian System mechanically seamed roofing engineered to exceed Florida Miami-Dade building code", "Storm-rated protection tested to 325+ mph wind resistance"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1986 -> db", "Headquarters Minneola, Florida -> db", "Custom fabricates standing seam metal roof systems -> /", "Produces custom flashing (chimney caps, radius coping, window pans, Z flashing) -> /", "Wholesale materials: drip edge, butyl, RoofIvent Roto, Ecos -> /", "Guardian System mechanically seamed roofing exceeds Miami-Dade code -> /", "Serves roofing contractors and homeowners -> /", "Projects in Tavares, Florida -> /", "Mission: fast turnaround, personalized consultation, fair pricing, customer service -> /", "Over 40 years experience -> /", "Storm protection 325+ mph -> /", "Materials: Galvalume, Kynar, butyl, RoofIvent Roto, Ecos, drip edge -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Standing seam metal roof systems custom fabricated to your projects'' specifications.", "founded_year": "1986", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='superb-metals' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Tupelo, Mississippi, Superior Artisan Wood has established itself as the state''s only certified urban wood producer. The company processes locally sourced trees that might otherwise be wasted, turning urban wood into high-quality lumber and slabs while emphasizing heritage and sustainability.

The company provides custom mobile and stationary sawmilling for logs up to 60 inches in diameter, vacuum kiln drying to a target moisture content of 6–8 percent, wood sanitization, and sales of premium native hardwood lumber. Its sawmill produces dimensional lumber, beams, mantels, and custom live-edge slabs. Services are offered both at its Tupelo facility and on-site for customers across Lee County and North Mississippi.

Superior Artisan Wood serves woodworkers, contractors, arborists, homeowners, designers, and municipalities. Builders, furniture makers, and DIY enthusiasts purchase its rotating selection of kiln-dried hardwoods, while the log donation program allows community members to give fallen trees a second life.

