UPDATE companies SET description='Surface Mount Technology Corporation (SMT) was founded in 1997 in Appleton, Wisconsin. The company operates as an electronic manufacturing services (EMS) provider, offering engineering, prototyping, production, test, and higher-level assembly for original equipment manufacturers.

SMT delivers a connected suite of services that spans electronic design engineering, new product introduction, printed circuit board assembly, conformal coating, in-circuit and functional testing, custom test fixture development, supply chain management, and final product integration including enclosure assembly, cabling, labeling, serialization, and packaging.

The firm serves OEMs in industrial controls, instrumentation, test and measurement, automation, medical and medical-adjacent electronics, transportation and mobility, energy and environmental technology, and safety and security systems. Customers typically engage SMT when they need engineering, sourcing, manufacturing, test, and assembly to function as a single execution system rather than a series of handoffs.

