UPDATE companies SET description='System Packaging Company was founded in 1983 in Bell, California, as a family-owned business. The company began by providing flexible packaging solutions and has continued under family ownership for over four decades.

The company operates as both a custom packaging manufacturer and a stocking distributor, offering more than 1,500 stocked items. Its product line includes poly bags, reclosable ziplock bags, poly tubing, co-extruded vacuum bags, static control bags, poly mailers, polypropylene bags, custom packaging, and protective inflatable packaging. It also produces pallet covers, vented produce pouches, packing list envelopes, and wicketed bags.

Its food-grade packaging uses 100% virgin materials for fresh produce, baked goods, snacks, and frozen goods. Industrial packaging protects powders, granules, chemicals, and parts for construction, logistics, and manufacturing customers. Healthcare packaging is designed for infectious and hazardous waste disposal and for protecting sensitive medical products during transport.

