UPDATE companies SET description='TMS Custom Woodworks, LLC operates from Kailua-Kona on the island of Hawaii, with production shops in the Koloko Industrial Park and the Kohanaiki Industrial Park. The company describes its team as a group of individuals with over 40 years of combined experience in cabinetry and construction, though a specific founding year and ownership structure are not disclosed.

