UPDATE companies SET description='TOP-electronics USA operates from Tucson, Arizona, as the American arm of a global distribution business founded in 2005 by Arco Snoey in the Netherlands. The company began with a focus on connecting engineers with electronic components and technical expertise, growing into a knowledge-driven distributor with offices across EMEA, the Americas, and Asia.

The firm distributes electronic components and modules from a portfolio that spans wireless and IoT, test and measurement, motion control, precision analog, power conversion, displays and embedded computing, sensors, connectors and cables, and thermal management. Beyond fulfillment, it provides design-in support, component selection, lifecycle and end-of-life management, alternative sourcing, buffer stock programs, and logistics solutions, all backed by an ISO 9001:2015 quality system and ESD-protected handling.

Its specialists work with purchasers and technical decision-makers from prototype through scalable production, helping navigate supply-chain risks and component obsolescence.

