UPDATE companies SET description='Tarrier Foods Corporation operates from Columbus, Ohio, as a family-owned food processor founded by Ann, who left a previous role to start her own business blending nuts and dried fruits. The company does not disclose a founding year, but describes decades of expertise in the ingredient space.

