UPDATE companies SET description='Tech Electronics of Kansas City operates from Lenexa, Kansas, and has served the Midwest since its founding in 1963. The company provides building technology services across the Kansas City metropolitan area, including Jackson County, Clay County, and surrounding communities such as Independence, Overland Park, Blue Springs, and Olathe.

